Hi Jeff,
A major investigative report just surfaced in Korea about HYBE’s $1.2 billion acquisition of Ithaca Holdings. Since BTS and HYBE have been key topics in Billboard’s coverage, I thought this might be important for international readers as well.
@Jeff__Benjamin

It was a great pleasure to meet Mr. Bill Gates, whose extraordinary commitment to humanity continues to inspire the world. He announced a remarkable contribution of $1.2 billion towards the global effort to eradicate polio — a disease that now remains endemic in only two countries, Pakistan and Afghanistan. His philanthropy stands as a powerful example of compassion, leadership, and service to mankind.
On behalf of the Prime Minister and the people of Pakistan, I conveyed our deep gratitude for his unwavering support to this national and global cause. I also assured him that the present government has accorded the highest priority to eliminating polio once and for all from our country. Together, with strong international partnerships and our national resolve, we are determined to make polio free Pakistan.
